overplaying their hand

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.613
but we'll find out
about that, Dave.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.916
- Yeah, so do you miss Twitter?

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.784
That seems to be
the big question

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:25.919
