00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:26.820
That was your thing.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.521
Do you miss it at all?

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.957
- So something happened that's

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:33.093
I think you've seen and
it's very interesting.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.894 align:start size:84% position:16%
I do press releases
like I used to.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.730
You know the circle goes
round and round, right?

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.233
I do press releases and it
seems that a lot of people

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.302 align:start size:84% position:16%
